<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Fleet cut to neutral.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Fleet cut to neutral.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Morgan Stanley said on Friday it had cut its rating on Fleet Financial Group Inc to neutral from outperform.</p>
<p>-- Fleet's stock closed at 52-1/4 on Thursday.</p>
<p>-- Wall Street Desk (212) 859-1730</p>
</text>
